# Monomial coefficients (ascending powers of z = 2u^2-1, u = x/6) of the even part of
# gelu(6u): gelu(x) ~= 3u + poly(z), saturated outside |x| > 6. Derived from the
# Chebyshev series of the exact (erf) GELU; measured epilogue error 7e-4 absolute,
# independent of the backend's transcendental lowering.
